{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"40c376e3-9469-4918-bb1c-06ce453fc597","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have Q1.5:\n\n**Q1.5**: 多算子并发在算法层面面临哪些关键挑战和约束？（数据依赖导致的串行化瓶颈——如 MoE 的 routing decision 必须先于 expert 计算、DiT 的 denoising step 间存在严格时序依赖、多模态的 cross-attention 依赖两模态编码完成、Video 的 temporal attention 依赖多帧特征就绪；算子并发粒度选择——粗粒度（整层/整模块）vs 细粒度（微算子/tile 级）的 trade-off；并发算子间的负载均衡——不同 expert 的计算量不均、不同模态编码器计算量差异；结合硬件体系结构侧重：并发对片上 memory bandwidth 的竞争、对计算单元利用率的影响、对控制流和同步开销的要求）\n\n**预关键词**: 数据依赖, data dependency, 串行化瓶颈, serialization bottleneck, 并发粒度, concurrency granularity, coarse-grained parallelism, fine-grained parallelism, tile级并发, tile-level concurrency, 负载均衡, load balancing, expert imbalance, computation skew, memory bandwidth竞争, bandwidth contention, 计算单元利用率, compute unit utilization, 同步开销, synchronization overhead, barrier synchronization, 控制流开销, control flow overhead, 片上互连, on-chip interconnect\n\nNow I need to:\n1. Semantic segmentation of the question\n2. Search in 4 directories using omnisearch\n3. Read top 15-20 notes\n4. Write answer\n\nLet me segment the question into sub-topics and search:\n\nSemantic sub-topics:\n1. Data dependency / serialization bottleneck - MoE routing, DiT denoising, cross-attention, temporal attention\n2. Concurrency granularity - coarse vs fine-grained, micro-operator, tile-level\n3. Load balancing - expert imbalance, computation skew\n4. Memory bandwidth contention, compute unit utilization\n5. Synchronization overhead, barrier, control flow\n6. On-chip interconnect\n\nLet me search for these across the four directories. I'll launch multiple searches in parallel.","signature":"40c376e3-9469-4918-bb1c-06ce453fc597"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":23807,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":19968,"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2aa3a21e-