ngines 处理后通过 CXL.mem DMA 将选定的 KV pages 传回 GPU。\\n从芯片设计角度拆解术语：\\nCXL Type-3 KV Cache 的物理组织和数据路径：\\n```\\n# === Physical Topol…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/TMAC (Tile Multiplier-Accumulator) _ Vector-Tile MAC（向量-瓦片乘累加器）.md\",\"basename\":\"TMAC (Tile Multiplier-Accumulator) _ Vector-Tile MAC（向量-瓦片乘累加器）\",\"score\":29.009372327339197,\"foundWords\":[\"on\",\"on-the-fly\",\"on-chip）或outer-product\",\"on-chip\",\"chip\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":214},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":294},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":384},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":409},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":533},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":541},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":696},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":753},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":960},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1017},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1071},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1087},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1220},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1488},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1537},{\"match\":\"on-chip）或outer-product\",\"offset\":1540},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1699},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1768},{\"match\":\"on-the-fly\",\"offset\":1936},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1959},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":1990},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":2134},{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":2175}],\"excerpt\":\"…cumulator，也称Vector-Tile MAC）是RPU论文提出的一种专用矩阵乘法硬件单元，用于加速LLM decode中dominant的Vector-Matrix Multiplication (VMM)操作。每个TMAC由64个MAC单元组成，排列为8×8阵列，支持BF16乘法+FP32累加（BF16×BF16→FP32）。一个activation vector的8个元素被广播到8列weight matrix上，每cycle计算64个MAC操作。TMAC采用**weight-streaming, output-stationary dataflow**：activation保持不动（broadcast across columns），weight元素逐tile被stream进TMAC，partial sum驻留在local accumulator中直到一个stripe完成后再…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Systolic-array Accelerator (for VLM Inference).md\",\"basename\":\"Systolic-array Accelerator (for VLM Inference)\",\"score\":28.28975784185092,\"foundWords\":[\"on\",\"on嵌在array的memory\",\"on-chip\",\"chip\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"on\",\"offset\":141},{\"match\":\